            "review_text": "IsaacG16\nDaw Park, Australia111 contributions\n0\nDelicious broken rice with kimchi\nApr 2023 • Couples\nCà phê Đỗ-Phủ is a little way from the more touristy parts of Saigon, but still just a quick ride in a Grab. Their specialty is broken rice with kimchi (delicious), which was originally served at the request of the Korean soldiers stationed nearby – you can read more about the interesting history of the cafe by searching \"The war-time secret behind Saigon eatery\".\n\nHighly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 4, 2023",
